-- Tests for Dieu 144-154. V1 pinned at 1 June 2025, V2 at 1 March 2026, V3 at 1 August 2026.

§ `Tests: Chuong V and VI`

§§ `Dieu 144`

@@qb 291 302
@ref Dieu 144 (src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:291-302)
@@fx `a micro product at every limit` : `A microinsurance product` ; `is short and easy to understand with simple or no underwriting` = TRUE ; `covers only the basic protection of life, health and property` = TRUE ; `term in years` = 5 ; `sum insured per contract` = 20_000_000 ; `annual premium per insured person of a contract` = 1_000_000 ; `maximum sum insured per contract the Government sets` = JUST 20_000_000 ; `maximum annual premium per insured person the Government sets` = JUST 1_000_000
@@fx `a micro product of six years` : `A microinsurance product` ; `is short and easy to understand with simple or no underwriting` = TRUE ; `covers only the basic protection of life, health and property` = TRUE ; `term in years` = 6 ; `sum insured per contract` = 20_000_000 ; `annual premium per insured person of a contract` = 1_000_000 ; `maximum sum insured per contract the Government sets` = JUST 20_000_000 ; `maximum annual premium per insured person the Government sets` = JUST 1_000_000
@@fx `a micro product over the sum cap` : `A microinsurance product` ; `is short and easy to understand with simple or no underwriting` = TRUE ; `covers only the basic protection of life, health and property` = TRUE ; `term in years` = 1 ; `sum insured per contract` = 20_000_001 ; `annual premium per insured person of a contract` = 1_000_000 ; `maximum sum insured per contract the Government sets` = JUST 20_000_000 ; `maximum annual premium per insured person the Government sets` = JUST 1_000_000
@@fx `a micro product over the premium cap` : `A microinsurance product` ; `is short and easy to understand with simple or no underwriting` = TRUE ; `covers only the basic protection of life, health and property` = TRUE ; `term in years` = 1 ; `sum insured per contract` = 20_000_000 ; `annual premium per insured person of a contract` = 1_000_001 ; `maximum sum insured per contract the Government sets` = JUST 20_000_000 ; `maximum annual premium per insured person the Government sets` = JUST 1_000_000
@@fx `a micro product that is complex` : `A microinsurance product` ; `covers only the basic protection of life, health and property` = TRUE ; `term in years` = 1 ; `maximum sum insured per contract the Government sets` = JUST 20_000_000 ; `maximum annual premium per insured person the Government sets` = JUST 1_000_000
@@fx `a micro product with no caps supplied` : `A microinsurance product` ; `is short and easy to understand with simple or no underwriting` = TRUE ; `covers only the basic protection of life, health and property` = TRUE ; `term in years` = 1
#ASSERT `Dieu 144: the product has the characteristics of a microinsurance product` `a micro product at every limit`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 144: the product has the characteristics of a microinsurance product` `a micro product of six years`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 144: the product has the characteristics of a microinsurance product` `a micro product over the sum cap`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 144: the product has the characteristics of a microinsurance product` `a micro product over the premium cap`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 144: the product has the characteristics of a microinsurance product` `a micro product that is complex`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 144: the product has the characteristics of a microinsurance product` `a micro product with no caps supplied`

§§ `Dieu 145 to 150`

@@qb 304 405
@ref Dieu 145-150 (src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:304-405)
@@fx `an approved insurer supplier` : `A supplier of microinsurance` ; `is an insurer or foreign non-life branch licensed in Vietnam` = TRUE ; `registered the premium method and the Ministry of Finance approved it` = TRUE ; `keeps revenue and cost of microinsurance separate from other activity` = TRUE
@@fx `an insurer supplier mixing the accounts` : `A supplier of microinsurance` ; `is an insurer or foreign non-life branch licensed in Vietnam` = TRUE
@@fx `a mutual organisation serving its members and sharing profit` : `A supplier of microinsurance` ; `is a mutual organisation licensed in Vietnam` = TRUE ; `supplies only to its own members` = TRUE ; `the buyer is both a member and an owner` = TRUE ; `all profit is used for the members' benefit` = TRUE
@@fx `a mutual organisation selling outside its members` : `A supplier of microinsurance` ; `is a mutual organisation licensed in Vietnam` = TRUE ; `the buyer is both a member and an owner` = TRUE ; `all profit is used for the members' benefit` = TRUE
@@fx `a mutual organisation paying out profit` : `A supplier of microinsurance` ; `is a mutual organisation licensed in Vietnam` = TRUE ; `supplies only to its own members` = TRUE ; `the buyer is both a member and an owner` = TRUE
@@fx `an unlicensed supplier` : `A supplier of microinsurance`
#ASSERT `Dieu 145(2): the supplier registered the premium method and had it approved` `an approved insurer supplier`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 145(2): the supplier registered the premium method and had it approved` `an unlicensed supplier`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 145(3)-(4): the Government's and the Minister of Finance's rules on support measures, registration and premium methods for microinsurance`
#ASSERT `Dieu 146(1): the supplier is a kind of provider the Law allows` `an approved insurer supplier`
#ASSERT `Dieu 146(1): the supplier is a kind of provider the Law allows` `a mutual organisation serving its members and sharing profit`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 146(1): the supplier is a kind of provider the Law allows` `an unlicensed supplier`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 146(2): the Government's rules on licensing mutual organisations`
#ASSERT `Dieu 147(2): the insurer or foreign non-life branch keeps microinsurance revenue and cost separate` `an approved insurer supplier`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 147(2): the insurer or foreign non-life branch keeps microinsurance revenue and cost separate` `an insurer supplier mixing the accounts`
#ASSERT `Dieu 147(2): the insurer or foreign non-life branch keeps microinsurance revenue and cost separate` `a mutual organisation serving its members and sharing profit`
#ASSERT `Dieu 148(1): the mutual organisation supplies only to its members` `a mutual organisation serving its members and sharing profit`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 148(1): the mutual organisation supplies only to its members` `a mutual organisation selling outside its members`
#ASSERT `Dieu 148(1): the mutual organisation supplies only to its members` `an approved insurer supplier`
#ASSERT `Dieu 148(2): the rules of Chuong II apply to the mutual organisation's contract of the class` `the general rules on insurance contracts`
#ASSERT `Dieu 148(2): the rules of Chuong II apply to the mutual organisation's contract of the class` `life insurance contracts`
#ASSERT `Dieu 148(2): the rules of Chuong II apply to the mutual organisation's contract of the class` `health insurance contracts`
#ASSERT `Dieu 148(2): the rules of Chuong II apply to the mutual organisation's contract of the class` `property insurance contracts`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 148(2): the rules of Chuong II apply to the mutual organisation's contract of the class` `damage insurance contracts`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 148(2): the rules of Chuong II apply to the mutual organisation's contract of the class` `liability insurance contracts`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 148(3): the Government's rules on the mutual organisation's microinsurance`
#ASSERT `Dieu 150(4): the mutual organisation uses all profit for its members` `a mutual organisation serving its members and sharing profit`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 150(4): the mutual organisation uses all profit for its members` `a mutual organisation paying out profit`
#ASSERT `Dieu 150(4): the mutual organisation uses all profit for its members` `an approved insurer supplier`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 150(5): the Government's rules on organisation, risk management, business, disclosure, finance, accounting and reporting of mutual organisations`
@@fx `a complete mutual applicant` : `A mutual organisation applicant` ; `founder is a Vietnamese citizen of full capacity who is a member of the organisation planning it` = TRUE ; `founding capital is in Vietnamese dong` = TRUE ; `founding capital` = 10_000_000_000 ; `minimum founding capital the Government sets` = JUST 10_000_000_000 ; `has a chair, a chief executive, a legal representative and a microinsurance actuary expected to meet the Government's conditions` = TRUE ; `has a plan to supply microinsurance fitting its members and network` = TRUE ; `has a draft charter fitting its aims and the Government's rules` = TRUE ; `has a suitable information technology system` = TRUE
@@fx `a mutual applicant founded by a representative body` : `A mutual organisation applicant` ; `founder is an organisation representing members as the law provides` = TRUE ; `founding capital is in Vietnamese dong` = TRUE ; `founding capital` = 10_000_000_000 ; `minimum founding capital the Government sets` = JUST 10_000_000_000 ; `has a chair, a chief executive, a legal representative and a microinsurance actuary expected to meet the Government's conditions` = TRUE ; `has a plan to supply microinsurance fitting its members and network` = TRUE ; `has a draft charter fitting its aims and the Government's rules` = TRUE ; `has a suitable information technology system` = TRUE
@@fx `a mutual applicant one dong short` : `A mutual organisation applicant` ; `founder is a Vietnamese citizen of full capacity who is a member of the organisation planning it` = TRUE ; `founding capital is in Vietnamese dong` = TRUE ; `founding capital` = 9_999_999_999 ; `minimum founding capital the Government sets` = JUST 10_000_000_000 ; `has a chair, a chief executive, a legal representative and a microinsurance actuary expected to meet the Government's conditions` = TRUE ; `has a plan to supply microinsurance fitting its members and network` = TRUE ; `has a draft charter fitting its aims and the Government's rules` = TRUE ; `has a suitable information technology system` = TRUE
@@fx `a mutual applicant without an information system` : `A mutual organisation applicant` ; `founder is a Vietnamese citizen of full capacity who is a member of the organisation planning it` = TRUE ; `founding capital is in Vietnamese dong` = TRUE ; `founding capital` = 10_000_000_000 ; `minimum founding capital the Government sets` = JUST 10_000_000_000 ; `has a chair, a chief executive, a legal representative and a microinsurance actuary expected to meet the Government's conditions` = TRUE ; `has a plan to supply microinsurance fitting its members and network` = TRUE ; `has a draft charter fitting its aims and the Government's rules` = TRUE
@@fx `a mutual applicant with no minimum supplied` : `A mutual organisation applicant` ; `founder is a Vietnamese citizen of full capacity who is a member of the organisation planning it` = TRUE ; `founding capital is in Vietnamese dong` = TRUE ; `founding capital` = 10_000_000_000
#ASSERT `Dieu 149: the mutual organisation applicant meets the conditions` `a complete mutual applicant`
#ASSERT `Dieu 149: the mutual organisation applicant meets the conditions` `a mutual applicant founded by a representative body`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 149: the mutual organisation applicant meets the conditions` `a mutual applicant one dong short`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 149: the mutual organisation applicant meets the conditions` `a mutual applicant without an information system`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 149: the mutual organisation applicant meets the conditions` `a mutual applicant with no minimum supplied`

